From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Mostly_Harmless <geek520170@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 10 Oct 2026 16:30:21 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 4/7] fix(ass): keep line placement inside the occupancy arrays

When a line is as tall as the display area (a small video, a large
font or a small --displayarea), findMin() compared array[-1] (top and
scrolling danmaku) or array[numOfLine] (bottom danmaku), and for bottom
danmaku it returned numOfLine - 1, so the caller then wrote
fixEndTime[-1]. AddressSanitizer reports a heap-buffer-overflow for
--resolution 64x38 --fontsize 38 --font-size-strict with two bottom
danmaku at the same time. When there is only one possible position,
return it directly.

A display area below one pixel (e.g. a 1 px tall video) also produced
zero-sized occupancy arrays that were then read and written; use at
least one row.
---
 src/AssFile/AssFile.c | 19 +++++++++++++++++++
 1 file changed, 19 insertions(+)

diff --git a/src/AssFile/AssFile.c b/src/AssFile/AssFile.c
index eaefe94..51c6459 100644
--- a/src/AssFile/AssFile.c
+++ b/src/AssFile/AssFile.c
@@ -1923,6 +1923,16 @@ int writeAssDanmakuPart(FILE *opF, DANMAKU *head, CONFIG config, STATUS *const s
         }
     }
 
+    /* 很小的分辨率与显示区域会截断为 0 行，后面的数组将为空却仍被读写 */
+    if (rollResY < 1)
+    {
+        rollResY = 1;
+    }
+    if (holdResY < 1)
+    {
+        holdResY = 1;
+    }
+
     if ((R2LToRightTime = (int *)malloc(rollResY * sizeof(int))) == NULL)
     {
         fclose(opF);
@@ -3712,6 +3722,10 @@ static int findMin(int *array, const int numOfLine, const int stopSubScript, con
     if (!mode)
     { /* 正序查找 */
         minSub = 0;
+        if (stopSubScript <= 0)
+        { /* 一行就占满显示区域，只能放在顶端；array[stopSubScript - 1] 越界 */
+            return minSub;
+        }
         for (cnt = minSub + 1; cnt < stopSubScript; cnt++)
         {
             if (array[cnt] < array[minSub])
@@ -3734,6 +3748,11 @@ static int findMin(int *array, const int numOfLine, const int stopSubScript, con
     }
     else
     { /* 逆序查找 */
+        if (stopSubScript >= numOfLine)
+        { /* 一行就占满显示区域，只能贴底放置；array[stopSubScript] 越界，
+             返回 numOfLine - 1 还会让调用方写到 array[-1] */
+            return numOfLine;
+        }
         minSub = numOfLine - 1;
         for (cnt = minSub - 1; cnt >= stopSubScript; cnt--)
         {
